    <string name="help_title">Help &amp; Tips</string>
    <string name="menu_help">Help</string>
    <string name="help_tip_area_title">1. Area Selection vs. Full Screen</string>
    <string name="help_tip_area_desc">Selecting a specific area (crop) yields higher recognition accuracy than capturing the entire screen. By framing only the speech bubble or paragraph you want to read, you prevent background elements, graphics, or ads from confusing the OCR.</string>
    <string name="help_tip_kanji_title">2. Tips for Complex Kanji and Furigana</string>
    <string name="help_tip_kanji_desc">If OCR fails on a complex kanji character or skips small furigana readings, try zooming in on the page before capturing, or use area selection cropped tightly around the text. Smaller, enlarged crops significantly improve recognition accuracy for detailed glyphs.</string>
    <string name="help_tip_engines_title">3. Recognition Engines Comparison</string>
    <string name="help_tip_engines_desc">• Automatic: Uses Google Lens (maximum accuracy) and falls back to offline ML Kit if network is unavailable.\n\n• Manga-OCR: Offline AI specialized in vertical manga text and stylized fonts.\n\n• Google Lens Only: Maximum accuracy on manga and vertical stylized text, requires an active internet connection.\n\n• ML Kit Only: Runs 100% offline on-device. Excellent for standard printed text.</string>
    <string name="help_tip_behaviours_title">4. Application Behaviours</string>
    <string name="help_tip_behaviours_desc">• Auto-copy: Automatically copies recognized text to your clipboard.\n\n• Line by line: Displays text separated line by line in the panel.\n\n• Choose segment: Lets you select the exact text block to extract.\n\n• Snap bubble: Keeps the floating bubble anchored to screen edges.\n\n• Upscale crops: Improves reading accuracy on tiny fonts.\n\n• Captured image: Displays image crop alongside recognized text.</string>
    <string name="help_tip_dicts_title">5. Dictionaries &amp; Legal Attributions</string>
    <string name="help_tip_dicts_desc">Supports Yomitan/Yomichan format dictionaries (such as JMdict, KANJIDIC, etc.). List order defines search priority. Legal credits and licenses for each dictionary are available on the dictionary management screen.</string>
    <string name="help_tip_ai_title">6. Ask an AI</string>
    <string name="help_tip_ai_desc">Sends extracted text along with a custom prompt to any AI app installed on your phone (such as Gemini, ChatGPT, etc.) with a single tap.</string>
    <string name="help_tip_translation_title">7. Offline Translation Notice</string>
    <string name="help_tip_translation_desc">Offline translation performed by the on-device model (ML Kit) is limited and may contain contextual inaccuracies, especially for Japanese. For higher precision, consult detailed dictionary entries or use Ask AI / external specialized tools.</string>

